From 602bb0cf1ce5287f7f9fd34d7722d86f9d5c5c49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: devilAPI <felixseiboldt@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 07:20:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] axon7: props split for lineage-22.2, amplifier props on
 persist.vendor

system.prop keeps the framework props only; vendor-read props move to
vendor.prop as in msm8996-common 22.2, with its Bluetooth profile props.
Drops the makefile lines that ended up in system.prop and ro.vndk.version.

The 18.1 persist.axon7.amp_hal_device_map default named snd_device
numbers that are off by one on the 22.2 audio HAL (VOICE_SPEAKER_STEREO
was added); the mono speakerphone devices are named in the default table
now. Overrides read persist.vendor.axon7.amp_hal_* with its own property
context, and an out-of-range snd_device is rejected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FVN6i1nM3y1ifpqjS4n7PW
---
 PORTING-22.2.md                      | 12 +++-
 audio_amplifier/audio_amplifier.c    | 24 +++++---
 product.prop                         |  3 +
 sepolicy/vendor/hal_audio_default.te |  2 +
 sepolicy/vendor/property.te          |  2 +
 sepolicy/vendor/property_contexts    |  3 +
 system.prop                          | 78 +++---------------------
