diff --git a/PORTING-22.2.md b/PORTING-22.2.md
index 38380ee..0d594cb 100644
--- a/PORTING-22.2.md
+++ b/PORTING-22.2.md
@@ -21,6 +21,13 @@ nearest msm8996 tree that runs 22.2 (see zte-axon7 lineageos/BUILD-PLAN-LOS22.md
 - Android.mk: only the include; Wi-Fi firmware links as install_symlink.
 - extract-files.sh: msm8996-common's 22.2 fixups for the shared blobs,
   no vndk v28; setup-makefiles.sh: CHECKELF off.
+- Props: system.prop holds only framework props, the rest moved to
+  vendor.prop (msm8996-common 22.2 split; Bluetooth profile props added);
+  the stray makefile lines and ro.vndk.version=28 are gone.
+- audio_amplifier: the mono speakerphone devices are named in the default
+  table (the 18.1 prop's snd_device numbers are off by one on the 22.2
+  audio HAL), override prop persist.vendor.axon7.amp_hal_* with its own
+  context (vendor_axon7_amp_prop), out-of-range snd_device rejected.
 - touch/: key disabler as AIDL vendor.lineage.touch V1 (NDK),
   vendor.lineage.touch-service.axon7, same 0dbutton node.
 - lineage.dependencies: empty (kernel via the local manifest).
@@ -32,6 +39,5 @@ nearest msm8996 tree that runs 22.2 (see zte-axon7 lineageos/BUILD-PLAN-LOS22.md
    proprietary-files.txt; RIL/IMS versions in manifest.xml and the
    netmgrd/qcrild choice in init.qcom.rc follow the chosen blobs.
 3. ZteDoze (Android.mk app) for API 35, or LineageOS's own doze.
-4. sepolicy property context for persist.axon7.amp_hal_device_map.
-5. Vendor image size: gemini's is 832 MiB, axon7's partition 512 MiB.
-6. Kernel: the 4.4 port (DTS, synaptics_dsx, AK4961/AK4490 audio, panel).
+4. Vendor image size: gemini's is 832 MiB, axon7's partition 512 MiB.
+5. Kernel: the 4.4 port (DTS, synaptics_dsx, AK4961/AK4490 audio, panel).
